{
    "chapter_num": 6,
    "verses_count": 22,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Wickedness and Judgment of Man"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it came to pass, when men began to multiply on the face of the earth, and daughters were born to them, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that the sons of God saw the daughters of men, that they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " beautiful; and they took wives for themselves of all whom they chose."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said, “My Spirit shall not strive"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "LXX, Syr., Tg., Vg. abide"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with man forever, for he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " indeed flesh; yet his days shall be one hundred and twenty years.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There were "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Heb. nephilim, fallen or mighty ones"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "giants on the earth in those days, and also afterward, when the sons of God came in to the daughters of men and they bore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "children"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to them. Those "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the mighty men who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of old, men of renown."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, Tg.; Vg. God; LXX Lord God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " saw that the wickedness of man "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " great in the earth, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " every intent"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "thought"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the thoughts of his heart "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " only evil "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "all the day"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "continually. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " was sorry that He had made man on the earth, and He was grieved in His heart. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said, “I will destroy man whom I have created from the face of the earth, both man and beast, creeping thing and birds of the air, for I am sorry that I have made them.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Noah found grace in the eyes of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Noah Pleases God"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This is the genealogy of Noah. Noah was a just man, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "blameless or having integrity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perfect in his generations. Noah walked with God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Noah begot three sons: Shem, Ham, and Japheth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The earth also was corrupt before God, and the earth was filled with violence. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So God looked upon the earth, and indeed it was corrupt; for all flesh had corrupted their way on the earth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Ark Prepared"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And God said to Noah, “The end of all flesh has come before Me, for the earth is filled with violence through them; and behold, I will destroy them with the earth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Make yourself an ark of gopherwood; make "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. compartments or nests"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "rooms in the ark, and cover it inside and outside with pitch. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And this is how you shall make it: The length of the ark "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " three hundred "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "A cubit is about 18 inches."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "cubits, its width fifty cubits, and its height thirty cubits. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You shall make a window for the ark, and you shall finish it to a cubit from above; and set the door of the ark in its side. You shall make it "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "with"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " lower, second, and third "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "decks."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And behold, I Myself am bringing floodwaters on the earth, to destroy from under heaven all flesh in which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the breath of life; everything that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on the earth shall die. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But I will establish My covenant with you; and you shall go into the ark—you, your sons, your wife, and your sons’ wives with you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And of every living thing of all flesh you shall bring two of every "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "sort"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " into the ark, to keep "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " alive with you; they shall be male and female. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Of the birds after their kind, of animals after their kind, and of every creeping thing of the earth after its kind, two of every "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "kind"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " will come to you to keep "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " alive. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you shall take for yourself of all food that is eaten, and you shall gather "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to yourself; and it shall be food for you and for them.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus Noah did; according to all that God commanded him, so he did."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}